# Local development only. Copy to .dev.vars (gitignored) and fill in.
#
# AUTH_SECRET is the only Worker secret (SRS §16.1). It signs the session
# cookie. Generate 32 random bytes, e.g.:
#     node -e "console.log(require('crypto').randomBytes(32).toString('base64url'))"
#
# ⚠ If AUTH_SECRET is unset the auth gate is DISABLED. That is deliberate, and
# it is a local convenience ONLY — the production build must refuse to start
# without it.
AUTH_SECRET=
